  "summary_en": "Polish Ministry of Digital Affairs' national AI policy to 2030 (November 2025). It sets a vision and measures for the AI ecosystem, infrastructure, open data, talent, public administration, security, business adoption, trustworthy AI, regulation, privacy, and financing. It aligns with the EU AI Act and OECD principles and focuses mainly on innovation promotion.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Aims to make Poland a leader of the EU 'AI Continent' by 2030",
   "Builds AI infrastructure, open data and open-source models, and talent programmes",
   "Creates AI HUB Poland for public administration deployments and AI in health and justice",
   "Aligns with the EU AI Act and OECD principles, with chapters on privacy, competition and copyright",
   "Funds AI via over PLN 100m annually, PFR Deep Tech, and an AI Funds Council"
